    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latent Technology's first tech demo: a glimpse into the future of games.\u00a0Step into a series of fully physical worlds powered by Generative Physics Animation technology, where characters' muscles are controlled by neural networks in real-time. Explore interactive environments where characters and objects respond dynamically to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully physical interactions:</strong> interact with characters that move and respond realistically in real-time with their environment, adding depth to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time neural networks:</strong>\u00a0dive into a future where neural networks drive the muscles of the characters in a fully responsive manner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing exploration:\u00a0</strong>no complex mechanics\u2014just you, the world, and the joy of discovery :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about racing to the finish\u2014it's about taking in the details and savoring the journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latent Technology's first tech demo: a glimpse into the future of games.\u00a0Step into a series of fully physical worlds powered by Generative Physics Animation technology, where characters' muscles are controlled by neural networks in real-time. Explore interactive environments where characters and objects respond dynamically to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully physical interactions:</strong> interact with characters that move and respond realistically in real-time with their environment, adding depth to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time neural networks:</strong>\u00a0dive into a future where neural networks drive the muscles of the characters in a fully responsive manner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing exploration:\u00a0</strong>no complex mechanics\u2014just you, the world, and the joy of discovery :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about racing to the finish\u2014it's about taking in the details and savoring the journey.</p>",
